    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbs with «pôr»",
     "texto": [
      "**propor** (to propose), **dispor** (to arrange), **compor** (to compose), **repor** (to restore). They are conjugated like **pôr**: **proponho** (I propose), **propõe** (he / she proposes), **disponho** (I arrange).",
      "**Pôr** (to put), **propor** (to propose), **compor** (to compose)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbs with «pedir»",
     "texto": [
      "**impedir** (to prevent), **despedir** (to dismiss): **impeço** (I prevent), **impede** (he / she prevents).",
      "Watch out: **despedir-se** means «to say goodbye»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
